{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54088","headline":"竹枝词（送李庚） · 刘瞻","name":"竹枝词（送李庚）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹑履过沟（竹枝）恨渠深（女儿）。\n（见《中朝故事》）（按：《中朝故事》：瞻「至湖南，李庾方典是郡，出迎於江次竹牌亭。\n置酒，瞻唱《竹枝词》送李庾〖略〗。\n庾慑怒，乃上酒於瞻。\n瞻命庾酬唱。\n庾云：『不晓词间音律』。\n瞻投杯曰：『君应只解爲制词也。\n』是夕，庾饮鸩而卒。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘瞻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}